WEBVTT

00:00:00.305 --> 00:00:02.652
I've been a startup's second engineering hire,

00:00:03.562 --> 00:00:04.326
a tech lead,

00:00:05.653 --> 00:00:09.528
and an engineer at a US software company serving Fortune 500

00:00:09.528 --> 00:00:10.312
retailers.

00:00:11.714 --> 00:00:15.464
Today, I work at Sweden's Caspeco, whose products are used across

00:00:15.464 --> 00:00:17.477
more than twenty thousand venues.

00:00:19.374 --> 00:00:20.158
I'm Minh Pham.

00:00:21.462 --> 00:00:23.809
I bring that experience to business websites,

00:00:26.343 --> 00:00:30.021
software, and integrations from the first brief through launch.

00:00:31.003 --> 00:00:34.903
For Amiba, I built a property website and an interactive sales

00:00:34.903 --> 00:00:35.750
presentation.

00:00:37.552 --> 00:00:39.591
For Moonstone Wellness, a website

00:00:40.095 --> 00:00:43.238
and management platform for bookings, memberships, and daily

00:00:43.238 --> 00:00:44.015
operations.

00:00:44.692 --> 00:00:47.297
Seven years of experience, Frontend to backend.

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:48.816
Have a project in mind?

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:50.055
Let's build it together.
